        "description": "Family history consistent with X-linked inheritance pattern",
        "category": "supportive",
        "requiredForDiagnosis": false
      }
    ],
    "minimumForDiagnosis": "Presence of bilateral absent radii, thrombocytopenia, and a pathogenic WAS gene mutation",
    "notes": "Diagnosis is confirmed by genetic testing; clinical features support diagnosis."
  },
